  "referenceNumber": "RUS3701",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State has reasonable grounds to suspect that \nNORTHERN ENGINEERING LIMITED LIABILITY COMPANY is an involved entity under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 because it is involved in: obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia, through carrying on business in a sector of strategic significance, namely, the Russian energy sector. \n",
